---
// ChapterOne.astro
// The Beginning: warm, pixelated, innocent childhood gaming
---

<section class="chapter-one" id="chapter-1">
  <div class="chapter-label pixel-text">// CHAPTER 01</div>

  <div class="content">
    <h2 class="chapter-title pixel-text">LEVEL 1:<br />JUST A KID</h2>

    <div class="game-scene" aria-label="Pixel art game animation">
      <!-- Simple CSS sprite animation of a running character -->
      <div class="ground"></div>
      <div class="clouds">
        <div class="cloud cloud-1"></div>
        <div class="cloud cloud-2"></div>
        <div class="cloud cloud-3"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="character" aria-hidden="true">▶</div>
      <div class="platforms">
        <div class="platform p1"></div>
        <div class="platform p2"></div>
        <div class="platform p3"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="essay-text">
      <p>
        <!-- TODO: Replace with your own intro paragraph -->
        It started simply. A console under the Christmas tree, a cartridge,
        a controller worn smooth at the thumbsticks. For millions of kids born
        in the 2000s, video games were the defining hobby of childhood — social,
        creative, and completely benign.
      </p>
      <p>
        <!-- TODO: Add your context / personal anecdote here -->
        I was one of them. My story is not unique. That's exactly the problem.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .chapter-one {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: var(--c1-bg);
    color: var(--c1-text);
    padding: var(--section-padding);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Subtle pixel-grid background */
  .chapter-one::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.15) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.15) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 32px 32px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .chapter-label {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--c1-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .chapter-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--c1-text);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  /* ---- Game Scene ---- */
  .game-scene {
    position: relative;
    height: 180px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #87ceeb 0%, #c9e8f5 60%, #a8d8a8 60%);
    border: 4px solid var(--c1-text);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
  }

  .ground {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 40px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      #5a8a3c 0px, #5a8a3c 32px,
      #4a7a2c 32px, #4a7a2c 64px
    );
  }

  /* Clouds */
  .cloud {
    position: absolute;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 50px;
    top: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }
  .cloud::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 60%;
    height: 200%;
    top: -50%;
    left: 20%;
  }
  .cloud-1 { width: 80px; animation: drift 18s linear infinite; left: 100%; }
  .cloud-2 { width: 60px; animation: drift 24s linear infinite 6s; left: 100%; top: 35px; }
  .cloud-3 { width: 100px; animation: drift 20s linear infinite 12s; left: 100%; top: 10px; }

  @keyframes drift {
    from { transform: translateX(0); }
    to   { transform: translateX(calc(-100vw - 200px)); }
  }

  /* Running character */
  .character {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 44px;
    left: 15%;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    animation: run 0.4s steps(1) infinite;
    color: var(--c1-text);
    font-family: var(--font-pixel);
  }

  @keyframes run {
    0%  { transform: scaleX(1)   translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: scaleX(1)   translateY(-2px); }
  }

  /* Platforms */
  .platform {
    position: absolute;
    height: 12px;
    background: #8B4513;
    border-top: 4px solid #a0522d;
    bottom: 40px;
  }
  .p1 { width: 80px;  left: 35%;  bottom: 80px; }
  .p2 { width: 100px; left: 55%;  bottom: 100px; }
  .p3 { width: 60px;  left: 75%;  bottom: 120px; }

  /* Essay text */
  .essay-text {
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .essay-text p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
</style>
